Directory Opus Internal Key Equivalents

AMIGA-B .... Bufferlist (tiny B button)
AMIGA-R .... Reselect   (tiny R button)
AMIGA-S .... Select     (tiny S button)
AMIGA-A .... ARexx      (tiny A button)

HELP    .... Toggle Help mode
SPACE   .... Activate other window
RETURN  .... Activate path field of current window
-       .... Size window full to the right
=       .... Center window sizing
\       .... Size window full to the left

Cursor
   keys .... Move around in directory windows
+ SHIFT .... Move a page in that direction
+ CTRL  .... Move to beginning/end
+ ALT   .... Move to previous/next buffer

Any key .... Scroll to first entry starting with that letter
+ SHIFT .... Scroll to first file starting with that letter
